b15 is a text with value "Adjusting a date", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b16 is a text with value "Move a date forward with add, or backward with remove. Both the singular and plural spelling of a unit are accepted, so 1 day and 7 days both work:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b17 is a text with value "add 7 days to date\nremove 1 month from date", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b17label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b17copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
