b20 is a text with value "Formatting", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b21 is a text with value "format ... as ... into ... produces text. It does not change the date it was given:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b22 is a text with value "format date as \"MM/dd/yyyy\" into text\nsay text\nsay date", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b22label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b22copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b22head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
