b23 is a text with value "The second say still prints the original date, untouched.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b24 is a text with value "The difference between two dates", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b25 is a text with value "days between is an expression, so assign it with the same is form used for every other value:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b26 is a text with value "startDate is date from \"2024-01-15\"\nendDate is date from \"2024-03-01\"\nwaiting is days between startDate and endDate\nsay waiting", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b26label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b26copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b26head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
