b27 is a text with value "The expression can also be used directly wherever a value is expected:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b28 is a text with value "startDate is date from \"2024-01-15\"\nendDate is date from \"2024-03-01\"\nsay days between startDate and endDate", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
